#: Mods/Remote_Factory/Source/Remote_Factory/Remote_FactoryResearchTree.cpp(908)
msgid ",TreeDesc_Remote_Factory"
msgstr "Research the Remote Factory's upgrade buildings level by level in the MAM. Each level costs more than the last; the matching building scales automatically."

#. Key:	Player_Unknown
